sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Notebook / Script)
    participant TrustyAI as trustyai<br/>Python Package
    participant JVM as JPype JVM<br/>(Java Explainability Engine)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>HTTPS
    participant TrustyAISvc as TrustyAI Service<br/>HTTPS (OpenShift Route)
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>HTTPS (openshift-monitoring)
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>HTTPS (OpenShift Route)

    Note over User,Model: Initialization Flow
    User->>TrustyAI: import trustyai
    TrustyAI->>JVM: Initialize JVM via JPype1<br/>--add-opens=java.base/java.nio=ALL-UNNAMED
    JVM-->>TrustyAI: JVM Ready<br/>(explainability-arrow JAR loaded)

    Note over User,Model: Local Explainability (no network)
    User->>TrustyAI: explainer.explain(model, data)
    TrustyAI->>JVM: Java explainability call<br/>(LIME / SHAP / PDP / Counterfactual)
    JVM-->>TrustyAI: Explanation result
    TrustyAI-->>User: Python explanation object

    Note over User,Model: TrustyAI Service Interaction
    User->>TrustyAI: TrustyAIMetricsService(token)
    TrustyAI->>K8sAPI: Discover Route "trustyai-service"<br/>Dynamic client (api_version=v1, kind=Route)
    K8sAPI-->>TrustyAI: Route spec.host → HTTPS URL
    TrustyAI->>K8sAPI: Discover Route "thanos-querier"<br/>namespace=openshift-monitoring
    K8sAPI-->>TrustyAI: Route spec.host → HTTPS URL

    User->>TrustyAI: service.upload_data(data)
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAISvc: POST /data/upload<br/>Auth: Bearer {token}
    TrustyAISvc-->>TrustyAI: 200 OK

    User->>TrustyAI: service.get_metric("spd")
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAISvc: POST /metrics/spd/request<br/>Auth: Bearer {token}
    TrustyAISvc-->>TrustyAI: Metric schedule created

    TrustyAI->>Thanos: GET /api/v1/query<br/>PromQL expression<br/>Auth: Bearer {token}
    Thanos-->>TrustyAI: Metric time-series data
    TrustyAI-->>User: Metric results

    Note over User,Model: Model Inference via Service
    User->>TrustyAI: service.infer(model_name, payload)
    TrustyAI->>K8sAPI: Discover Route for model<br/>Dynamic client
    K8sAPI-->>TrustyAI: Model route URL
    TrustyAI->>Model: POST /infer<br/>Auth: Bearer {token}
    Model-->>TrustyAI: Inference response
    TrustyAI-->>User: Prediction result
